{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello //\nこんちゃんわ、\nろってぃ-だよ-( ´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/08/14/9230321/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、仕事から帰ってきて\n大阪の親友と言える友達と\n電話してたのね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々おしゃべりしてて\n「乃木坂の好きな曲何〜？？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って話になったらなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(友)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『えっとなぁ〜\nあれや あの 〜\nいってらっしゃい\nコンディショナー。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってらっしゃい コンディショナー\n？？？   笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何やねんそれ (´▽`)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーのことかいな 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(友)\n『うん！ あ、それ\nおいでシャンプー 。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、でも やっぱ\n制服のマネキンが一番らしいです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスがちょっと\nお気に入りみたい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話したら 面白くて元気が出る☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょん.\n話かえちゃう。ちゃうちゃう犬☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のNOGIBINGO!は\nカラオケどぼん！とゆう企画でしたねん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組見て 皆 コメントしてくれて\nありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しゅうキモチ＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは 明日も１日 頑張ろうねっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph